      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since a month ago VRChat is freezing for me during \"Initializing World..\" step in any world that contains a video player.\n\nWith video players being present in a lot of the worlds, and with video players now forced enabled for everyone including Linux, this poses a really big usability issue.\n\nI've been trying to get attention to this issue for a month now without any response.\n\nHaving a way to disable video players via launch options or similar would provide a workaround for the problem while a fix is made (if ever).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
