  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When running VRChat on Proton(Linux), AVPro is disabled from VRChat 2020.3.1 to ensure stable operation\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202031#changes\nThis is because the WMF(Windows Media Foundation) emulation was not properly implemented in Proton at the time,\nbut Wine 6.0 supports WMF and Proton 6.3 merges this update.\nhttps://www.winehq.org/announce/6.0\nhttps://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/releases/tag/proton-6.3-1\nAs mentioned above, AVPro may work on the current Proton.\nBut we can't test it and we're not sure if it works.\nSo, please add an option to enable AV Pro on Proton.\nThis allows us to test AVPro on Proton and has no effect on the current behavior.\nThere are several ways to implement the options, but a command line option would be great because it is easy to test.",
